      "writtenOn": "2026-02-27T16:28:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "API DESIGN: The description of value 2 does not mention QP offsets at all, so my first reaction is that this should become a separate encoder option. I guess you made it a new value of `use_fixed_qp_offsets` because it is mutually exclusive with the current two values of `use_fixed_qp_offsets`?",
      "revId": "ad380040f9868501de9cdbbd869c7df73d21393f",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
