      "writtenOn": "2026-02-27T16:28:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With the addition of value 2, the comment for value 0 needs updating, because value 2 also does not use fixed QP offsets.\n\nBased on the help messages in av1/arg_defs.c (see my comment at line 902), I think we could say \"If a value of 0 is provided, encoder will adaptively choose QP offsets for frames at different levels of the pyramid.\"",
      "revId": "ad380040f9868501de9cdbbd869c7df73d21393f",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
